{
  "_readme": [
    "Labelled cases for eval/run_eval.py and eval/tune_weights.py.",
    "Each case supplies the vision/metadata/forensics a real request would have",
    "produced, so the pipeline's own fusion, verification and named-feature logic",
    "is what is being measured. Nominatim/Overpass are stubbed from `gazetteer`",
    "and `water_near`, which is why gazetteer keys must match the place names the",
    "cases use.",
    "",
    "expected fields: country, country_aliases, region, latitude, longitude,",
    "radius_km (max 2 km; the product defined radius), name_contains,",
    "expect_unknown, min_confidence, max_confidence.",
    "The confidence bands are calibration assertions: a scene with a named",
    "landmark should score high, an ambiguous forest should not, and a generated",
    "image must never score high whatever the scene suggests."
  ],
